# Chat Input — Claude-Style Upload Popover  

## Overview

Replace the single `Paperclip` button in the chat input bar with a `+` button that opens a floating popover menu with **3 distinct upload options** — exactly like Claude's UI. Each option opens the correct file picker or path input.

---

## Current State

```
[ 📎 ]  [ textarea ................................ ]  [ ➤ ]
```
Single `Paperclip` button directly opens a combined file picker (`accept` all types, `multiple`).

---

## Target State (Claude-style)

```
[ + ]  [ textarea .....................................]  [ ➤ ]
  ↑
  Opens popover ↓

┌───────────────────────────────────────┐
│  📄  Upload Files                      │
│      CSV, PDF, DOCX, TXT, JSON…        │
├───────────────────────────────────────┤
│  🖼️  Upload Images                     │
│      PNG, JPG, WEBP, GIF, SVG…         │
├───────────────────────────────────────┤
