## New Hidden File Inputs

Two separate hidden inputs (currently only one exists):

```jsx
<input ref={filePickerRef}  accept=".csv,.pdf,.docx,..." multiple />   {/* Documents */}
<input ref={imagePickerRef} accept="image/*" multiple />               {/* Images */}
```

---

## Folder Browse in Popover

```jsx
<input ref={folderPickerRef} type="file" webkitdirectory directory />
```
When the user selects a folder → first file's `webkitRelativePath` split to extract the folder name → set as workspace path.

