## Verification

1. Click `+` → popover appears above the button with 3 options
2. Click **Upload Files** → system file picker opens (docs/audio only); after selection, chips appear; popover closes
3. Click **Upload Images** → system file picker opens (images only); after selection, chips with thumbnails appear; popover closes
4. Click **Local Workspace** → workspace row expands inside popover; type or browse a path; press Enter → popover closes, workspace chip appears in file chips row
5. Click anywhere outside popover → closes
6. Press `Escape` → closes
7. Submit with any combination of files + workspace path → all appear in the user bubble in the chat thread
